  { q: 'What is a good LCP, INP, and CLS?', a: 'A page is rated good at a Largest Contentful Paint of 2.5 seconds or less, an Interaction to Next Paint of 200 milliseconds or less, and a Cumulative Layout Shift of 0.1 or less, measured at the 75th percentile of loads. The Best Answer Hub Website Speed Test frames its results against these thresholds.' },
